00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:10.800
<b><i>Keep Your Hands Off Eizouken!</i></b>

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.960
That building looks like a piece of shortcake!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:20.750
This leads to the mountain shrine, 
so I'd guess it was Main Street originally,

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.950
but the highway was headed in 
that direction, and cut it off!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.910
This looks like a bridge, 
but there's no river.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.810
Correct! There <i>used</i> to be a river.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:31.140
That's part of why the roads meander so much.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.460
Gives it a particular feel!

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:42.230
Behold! Those poles will 
split open, firing a missile!

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.180
Look at those! Like the top of tanks!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.750
A colossus that no one can see!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.310
Gigantic creatures!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.850
Mobilize the gantry cranes!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.820
I always used to imagine this 
stuff on the way home from school.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.660
Scorching...

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.410
We're gonna get sunburnt.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.100
The dimensional phase-shift vessel!

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.090
The water level's risen...

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.510
Must be from all the rain yesterday.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.860
It acts like a natural refrigerator...

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:34.350
Stop dawdling, Asakusa. It's obnoxious.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:38.420
Gotta say, I wasn't expecting you to suggest 
we go out of our way for lunch, Kanamori.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.410
You'd normally say it's a waste of time.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.020
You're up to something, aren't you?

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:44.110
Hey, what's that?

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.260
It's an offering. For kappas.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.280
Kappas?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:51.710
There are apparently legends about 
kappas having inhabited Shibahama.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:55.250
<b>Careful!!</b>

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:55.250
<b>Do not swim in or play</b>

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:55.250
<b>around the waterways</b>

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:55.250
<b>Scary!</b>

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.330
Likely because of how 
pristine the water is here.

